***REMOVED*** BFF API Configuration Example
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to .env or .env.local and modify as needed

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SERVER CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Server host and port
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8001

***REMOVED*** Environment: development, staging, production
ENVIRONMENT=development

***REMOVED*** Enable debug mode (forced to false in production)
DEBUG=false

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** LOGGING AND MONITORING
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Log level: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

***REMOVED*** Directory for log files
LOGS_DIR=logs

***REMOVED*** Performance monitoring
ENABLE_PERFORMANCE_METRICS=false

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** BACKEND SERVICE INTEGRATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Backend API service URL and settings
BACKEND_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
BACKEND_API_TIMEOUT=30

***REMOVED*** Recommendation API service URL
RECO_API_URL=http://localhost:8002

***REMOVED*** Authentication service URL
AUTH_API_URL=http://localhost:8003

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** CACHE AND REDIS SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Redis connection URL
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

***REMOVED*** Legacy cache TTL in seconds (300 = 5 minutes)
CACHE_TTL=300

***REMOVED*** Cache library settings
CACHE_KEY_PREFIX=bff:
CACHE_REDIS_POOL_SIZE=10
CACHE_REDIS_TIMEOUT=5
CACHE_ENABLE_METRICS=true

***REMOVED*** Domain-specific cache TTLs (in seconds)
CACHE_MOVIE_TTL=600        ***REMOVED*** 10 minutes for movie data
CACHE_USER_TTL=1800        ***REMOVED*** 30 minutes for user sessions
CACHE_POPULAR_TTL=900      ***REMOVED*** 15 minutes for popular content
CACHE_DEFAULT_TTL=300      ***REMOVED*** 5 minutes default

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** AUTHENTICATION AND SECURITY
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** JWT secret for token validation (MUST match across all services)
JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here-change-in-production

***REMOVED*** Service-to-service authentication key
INTERNAL_API_KEY=bff-to-backend-secret-key-change-in-production

***REMOVED*** Comma-separated list of allowed hosts
ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** CORS CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Comma-separated list of allowed origins for CORS
***REMOVED*** Use "*" to allow all origins (not recommended for production)
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8001,http://localhost:8002

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** DEVELOPMENT OVERRIDES
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Uncomment these for development environment
***REMOVED*** DEBUG=true
***REMOVED*** LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
***REMOVED*** ENABLE_PERFORMANCE_METRICS=true
***REMOVED*** HOST=127.0.0.1
